---
import Painting from './Painting.astro';
import { facts, path } from '../data/site';
---
<section class="section" id="about" aria-labelledby="story-title">
  <Painting name="gateway" dim={0.55} />
  <div class="wrap grid">
    <div class="glass strong pad bio">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h2 class="h2" id="story-title">A farm in Mandsaur, a hostel at eleven, and still climbing</h2>
      <p class="lede">
        I study Materials Science and Engineering at IIT Jammu. What I really spend my time learning is how businesses
        grow, how brands earn people’s trust, and how AI tools can multiply what one person or a small team can do.
      </p>
      <p class="body">
        I grew up in a farming family in Mandsaur, left home at eleven for a residential Navodaya school, and went to
        Kota on a scholarship before choosing to start at IIT Jammu straight away rather than spend another year
        chasing a different name. Farming taught me that an idea only matters when it produces something useful, and
        the hostel years taught me to figure things out on my own.
      </p>
      <p class="body">
        College is where I test that. I have automated sponsorship emails to 412 companies, helped run a case
        competition that reached 74 institutions, designed identities for campus events, and worked on positioning
        shops back home in Madhya Pradesh. The work keeps changing; the method mostly doesn’t: understand the system
        underneath, then build the simplest thing that creates real value. I am still early, and still learning
        how to finish what I start.
      </p>
      <p><a class="pill more" href="/story">Read the whole story, in ten chapters</a></p>
      <dl class="facts">
        {
          facts.map((f) => (
            <div>
              <dt>{f.k}</dt>
              <dd>{f.v}</dd>
            </div>
          ))
        }
      </dl>
    </div>

    <div class="glass strong pad climb" data-climb>
      <div class="climb-head">
        <h3>The climb</h3>
        <p>Six steps taken, one ahead. Take them one at a time.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="stairs" role="tablist" aria-label="Steps in Sonu’s story" aria-orientation="vertical">
        {
          path
            .slice()
            .reverse()
            .map((p) => {
              const i = path.indexOf(p);
              return (
                <button
                  type="button"
                  role="tab"
                  class="stair"
                  id={`step-${p.id}`}
                  aria-controls="step-panel"
                  aria-selected={i === 0 ? 'true' : 'false'}
                  tabindex={i === 0 ? 0 : -1}
                  data-step={i}
                  data-upcoming={'upcoming' in p ? '' : undefined}
                  style={`--i:${i}`}
                >
                  <span class="letter" aria-hidden="true">{p.letter}</span>
                  <span class="place">{p.place}</span>
                </button>
              );
            })
        }
      </div>
      <div class="step-panel" id="step-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby={`step-${path[0].id}`} aria-live="polite">
        {
          path.map((p, i) => (
            <div class="step-copy" data-step-copy={i} hidden={i !== 0}>
              <p class="step-label">
                <span aria-hidden="true">{p.letter}</span> {p.label}
              </p>
              <p>{p.text}</p>
            </div>
          ))
        }
        <button type="button" class="pill next" data-step-next>
          <span data-next-label>Climb a step</span>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 14h4v-4h4V6h4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"></path></svg>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.15fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 28px;
    align-items: stretch;
  }
  .bio {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
  }
  .body {
    font-size: 19px;
    color: var(--text-2);
  }
  .facts {
    margin: 6px 0 0;
    padding-top: 18px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
    font-size: 18px;
  }
  .facts div {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 16px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .facts dt {
    color: var(--text-3);
  }
  .facts dd {
    margin: 0;
    text-align: right;
  }

  .climb {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 22px;
  }
  .climb-head h3 {
    font-size: 30px;
  }
  .climb-head p {
    color: var(--text-2);
    font-size: 18px;
  }
  .stairs {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
  }
  /* Each step sits further right the higher it is: a staircase */
  .stair {
    --w: calc(100% - var(--i) * 8%);
    width: min(100%, var(--w));
    margin-left: calc(100% - min(100%, var(--w)));
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
    min-height: 46px;
    padding: 6px 16px;
    border-radius: 10px 10px 4px 4px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(237, 229, 220, 0.35);
    border-bottom: 3px solid rgba(237, 229, 220, 0.55);
    background: rgba(237, 229, 220, 0.08);
    color: var(--text-2);
    font: 17px/1.2 var(--body);
    text-align: left;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background 0.25s, color 0.25s, transform 0.25s;
  }
  .stair:hover {
    background: rgba(237, 229, 220, 0.18);
    color: #fff;
  }
  .stair[data-upcoming] {
    border-style: dashed;
    border-bottom-width: 1px;
    background: transparent;
    font-style: italic;
  }
  .stair[data-climbed] {
    background: rgba(237, 229, 220, 0.16);
    color: #fff;
  }
  .stair[aria-selected='true'] {
    background: var(--marble);
    color: var(--navy);
    border-color: var(--marble);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }
  .letter {
    font: 24px/1 var(--display);
    color: var(--red-hi);
    width: 22px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .stair[aria-selected='true'] .letter {
    color: var(--red);
  }
  .step-panel {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 14px;
    margin-top: auto;
    padding-top: 18px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
    min-height: 210px;
  }
  .step-copy {
    animation: rise 0.45s ease-out both;
  }
  .step-label {
    font: 22px/1.3 var(--display);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .step-label span {
    color: var(--red-hi);
  }
  .step-copy p:last-child {
    font-size: 19px;
    color: var(--text-2);
  }
  .next {
    align-self: flex-start;
    margin-top: auto;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1040px) {
    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .facts dd {
      text-align: left;
    }
    .stair {
      --w: calc(100% - var(--i) * 6%);
    }
  }
</style>
